# LunarFlux AI — Cursor Rules

## Framework & Environment — App Router 전용
- **항상 [Next.js App Router](https://nextjs.org/docs/app)만 사용합니다.** `app/` 디렉터리에 라우트·페이지·레이아웃을 둡니다.
- **Pages Router(`pages/`, `getServerSideProps` / `getStaticProps` 등)는 사용하지 않고, 새로 추가하지도 마세요.**
- Next.js 16, App Router, `output: 'export'`(정적 내보내기) — 서버 런타임 없음
- React는 Next.js 번들(React 19 호환)을 따릅니다

## TypeScript
- `tsconfig.json`은 `strict` + `noUnusedLocals` / `noUnusedParameters` / `noImplicitReturns` 등을 켜 두었습니다. **추론·자동완성에 맡기지 말고** 공개 API·props에는 타입을 명시합니다.
- 서비스 상세·슬러그 관련은 **`@/lib/app-types` 또는 `@/lib/servicesData`** — `ServiceData`, `ServiceSlug`, `SERVICE_SLUGS`, `getServiceBySlug` / `findServiceBySlug`를 사용합니다. (임의 `string`으로 슬러그를 쓰지 말고 `ServiceSlug` 또는 `findServiceBySlug`로 조회)

## Styling
- Use **Tailwind CSS v4** utility classes as the primary styling method
- Tailwind is imported via `@import "tailwindcss"` in `app/globals.css`
- CSS custom properties (CSS variables in `:root`) are still available and can be used alongside Tailwind
- For hover/focus effects in Server Components, prefer Tailwind `hover:` variants over JS event handlers
- Inline `style` props are acceptable for dynamic/computed values (e.g. `style={{ width: progress + '%' }}`)

## Server vs Client Components
- Default to **Server Components** (no `'use client'` at top)
- Add `'use client'` ONLY when using: `useState`, `useEffect`, `useRef`, browser APIs, or event handlers
- **NEVER** put `export const metadata` and `'use client'` in the same file — split into separate files

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG
'use client'
export const metadata = { title: '...' }

// ✅ CORRECT — split into two files
// page.tsx  →  export const metadata  (Server Component)
// ui.tsx    →  'use client'           (Client Component)
```

## Static Export Constraints
- Dynamic routes must define `generateStaticParams()`
- `useSearchParams()` must be wrapped in `<Suspense>`
- No Route Handlers or Middleware (not supported in static export)
- Use plain `<img>` or external image CDN instead of `next/image` optimizer

## Routing & Navigation
- Page links: `<Link href="...">` from `next/link`
- Programmatic navigation: `useRouter()` from `next/navigation` (not `next/router` for new code)
- External links: plain `<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">`

## SEO & Metadata
```tsx
import type { Metadata } from 'next'
export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: '페이지 제목 | LunarFlux AI',
  description: '페이지 설명',
  keywords: ['키워드1', '키워드2'],
  openGraph: { title: '...', description: '...', images: ['/og.png'] },
}
```

## Git & Deployment
- Always `git add` → `git commit` → `git push origin main` after completing tasks
- Commit messages in English, imperative style: `feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, `docs:`
- Deployment via Vercel (auto-deploys on push to main)

## Reference
- Next.js official docs: https://nextjs.org/docs
- App Router guide: https://nextjs.org/docs/app
- Static exports: https://nextjs.org/docs/app/guides/static-exports
- Project detail rules also in: `.cursor/rules/nextjs-latest.mdc`
